- **[judgement]** `R1_judgement`: STAGNANT {"verdict": "STAGNANT", "threshold": 0.1, "sigma": 0.05, "overall": {"baseline": 5.649e-06, "current": 5.649e-06, "r": 0.0}, "segments": {"seg1": {"baseline": 6.5584e-06, "current": 6.5584e-06, "r": 0.0, "usable": true, "judgment": "持平"}, "seg2": {"baseline": 4.6777e-06, "current": 4.6777e-06, "r": 0.0, "usable": true, "judgment": "持平"}, "seg3": {"baseline": 0.0, "current": 0.0, "r": null, "usable": false, "judgment": "不可判定", "reason": "baseline 为 0，该段无区分度"}}, "reasons": ["所有有效段变化均在阈值 10.0% 以内，视为噪声", "跳过不可判定的段: seg3（baseline 为 0 或缺失）", "⚠ sigma=0.05 为假定值，未用重复实验标定"]}
